=== parserErrorRecovery_ParameterList2.tlua ===
-- ported from tests/cases/conformance/parser/ecmascript5/ErrorRecovery/ParameterLists/parserErrorRecovery_ParameterList2.ts
-- dropped: @target: es2015 (tlua targets latest; the ES target is not a tlua concept)
-- rewritten: tlua has no `{`-delimited function body (the body starts after `)` and closes at
-- `end`), so the parameter list left dangling after a comma runs straight into `end`, the same
-- recovery point.
-- dropped: emit coverage (noEmit) -- the source is intentionally malformed, so whatever the parser
-- recovers is not meaningful Lua to baseline.

function f(a,
>f : (a: any) => any
>a : any

end

